<Layout
  title="Demo gallery - Engineering Portfolio"
  description="Internal page that mounts every demo Visualizer for build-time verification."
>
  <article class="dev-page gallery-page">
    <h1>Demo gallery</h1>
    <p>
      Every <code>*Visualizer.tsx</code> in the repo, grouped by course. Each
      demo hydrates lazily on scroll (<code>client:visible</code>) so this page
      stays cheap to load. Hidden from production nav - used as a build-time
      shakedown.
    </p>

    <nav class="gallery-toc" aria-label="Demos by course">
      <h2>Contents</h2>
      <ul>
      <li><a href="#mechatronics">Mechatronics (8)</a></li>
      <li><a href="#embedded-systems">Embedded Systems (10)</a></li>
