      <li><a href="#solid-mechanics">Solid Mechanics (10)</a></li>
      <li><a href="#distributed-systems">Distributed Systems & Fields (9)</a></li>
      <li><a href="#digital-electronics">Digital Electronics (9)</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>

